Notes Tech is a fully local Android note-taking app, written in Kotlin:
Markdown notes in a SQLCipher database, per-folder vaults encrypted with
AES-256-GCM, and on-device Whisper voice dictation.

Third-party components, with their licences and the notices those licences
require (SQLCipher, Bouncy Castle, whisper.cpp and ggml): see
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

Speech recognition model (NOT bundled, imported by the user from the official
source):
- Whisper Base / Tiny — OpenAI, ggml port by Georgi Gerganov, MIT
